<Layout
  title={"The Reality Code Engine: One Lossless Form for Native, Verified, Low-Energy Programming"}
  description={"About: The Reality Code Engine: One Lossless Form for Native, Verified, Low-Energy Programming. This paper describes the Reality Code Engine (RCE), a system in which a program is written once as a state machine, called a Form, and code in other languages is generated from it."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research paper · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      The Reality Code Engine: One Lossless Form for Native, Verified, Low-Energy Programming
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This paper describes the Reality Code Engine (RCE), a system in which a program is written once as a state machine, called a Form, and code in other languages is generated from it. It reports what was measured on 10,000 Forms and on public bug datasets, and states how the claims could be shown false.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>A program is written once, in one precise form, and the computer produces the same program in many languages from it.</li>
        <li>Because the form only allows what was declared, broken input is rejected at the door instead of being fixed later.</li>
        <li>A fix that passes the checks is saved and reused, so the same problem does not cost time or energy twice.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/rce/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/rce/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/rce.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
